        <dl class="dl-horizontal">

            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0014612</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The pathological mechanisms and forms taken by tissue during degeneration into a neoplasm and its subsequent activity.</dd>
            

            <dt>Terms</dt>

            

                <dd>
                <span id="Nightwatch_termName_0_0"
                      onclick="toggleCollapse('termName_0_0',
